    <briefdescription>
<para>Each SWIM packet carries meta info, which helps to determine SWIM protocol version, final packet destination and any other internal details, not linked with etalon SWIM protocol. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The meta header is mandatory, preceeds main protocol data as a separate MessagePack map. </para>    </detaileddescription>
